{"id":"30b79de3589c9f1e","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 End Extension","display":"df-zfc-tree9-end-extension — ZFC Tree9 End Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-end-extension — ZFC Tree9 End Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-end-extension — ZFC Tree9 End Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03eb55c90bb8f9b8\" href=\"?note=03eb55c90bb8f9b8\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,{\\le_T}\\in V\">\\(S,T,{\\le_T}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S\\)</span>（初始子树谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03eb55c90bb8f9b8\" href=\"?note=03eb55c90bb8f9b8\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9EndExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9EndExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本原子定义的端延伸谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}end\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9EndExtension}_S(T,S,{\\le_T})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S(S,T,{\\le_T})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}end\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9EndExtension}_S(T,S,{\\le_T})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S(S,T,{\\le_T})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 端延伸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 意味着没有新节点位于旧节点之下；等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中向下封闭。</li>\n<li>新节点可以有新的前驱。要求每个新节点的所有真前驱都属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 会错误地只允许单层式延伸。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"03eb55c90bb8f9b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"03eb55c90bb8f9b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S$（初始子树谓词，见 [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,{\\le_T}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9EndExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}end\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9EndExtension}_S(T,S,{\\le_T})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S(S,T,{\\le_T})","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1069,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3830","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-end-extension]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","03eb55c90bb8f9b8"]}